  "body": "4 Beds · 3 Baths · Garage & Covered Parking · Deck & Courtyard \r\n\r\nWelcome to 4 Mina Way, a stylish contemporary home in a boutique coastal setting, combining quality finishes with the relaxed appeal of village living.\r\n\r\nTowel over your shoulder, you’re just a three-minute stroll to the tide. Imagine waking up on Sunday morning, picking up a flat white, and browsing the bustling Browns Bay Market just across the street. Pick up prime cuts from the gourmet butcher downstairs, gather dinner party essentials from New World or Woolworths (barely 100m away), or treat yourself to arguably the best artisan handmade pasta on earth at local favourite restaurant, Palato. When dinner calls for spice, the coast’s top Indian restaurant is right across the road. This isn’t just a home; it’s an endless coastal holiday.\r\n\r\nThe Ground Floor Sanctuary (Work, Host, or Retreat):\r\nTucked privately away from the main living zones, find a tranquil bedroom opening straight out to garden access, serviced by its own full bathroom right next door. Whether you need a home office to run your empire, an independent haven for your teen, or a private suite for visiting guests, this floor delivers ultimate versatility. Complete with generous hallway storage, laundry, and internal access to the garage.\r\n\r\nLevel One: Where the Entertaining Happens:\r\nBathed in natural light, the mid-level is the social engine of the home. Anchored by an expansive entertainer’s kitchen with a generous breakfast island, cooking here is a social event. Oversized sliding doors connect the living room seamlessly to the deck which stretches the length of the room. Fire up the barbecue, pour a cold drink, and settle in for long, effortless summer afternoons.\r\n\r\nTop Floor: Rest & Indulgence:\r\nUpstairs is dedicated to peaceful rejuvenation. Two bright bedrooms share a sleek family bathroom, while the master suite is a true retreat: complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a designer ensuite featuring a double vanity and an oversized walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nEngineered with Substance:\r\nStill presenting like new, featuring low-maintenance materials and full double glazing. Equipped with 2 heat pumps / air conditioning units. \r\n\r\nThe Golden Extras:\r\n• No body corporate, simply a reasonable annual residents society fee \r\n• Great investment property \r\n• Pets: All pets welcome, with a dog-friendly beach just down the road\r\n• School Zones: In zone for Browns Bay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nReady to live the beachside village dream? Get in touch for your private viewing or call in to one of the scheduled viewing times.\r\n\r\nAll agents welcome - conjunctions invited.\r\nMarketed by: Tara Menzies and Cindy Leong",
